# Decaying Soil with threshold (Brain Freeze with storm 6 on Bot1 on turn 1: 22 cards in the graveyard).
# "Whenever a nontoken creature is put into your graveyard from the battlefield": a creature goes to its owner's
# graveyard, so on turn 4 Bot2 bolting its own Ornithopter puts it into Bot2's graveyard, not Bot1's, and nothing
# triggers. Bot2 then bolts Bot1's Ornithopter: the trigger goes on the stack, and Bot1 declines to pay {1} ("you may"),
# so the Ornithopter stays in the graveyard and Bot1 keeps its untapped Mox Ruby. On turn 6 Bot2's Chain of Smog makes
# Bot1 discard the second Ornithopter from its hand: a creature put into the graveyard, but not from the battlefield,
# so again nothing triggers.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
